(7316741, 1141835, 96751, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what to make of this image. The flying thing and fueling mechanism are very Jules Verne and Steampunky. But the guy in the baseball cap confuses me. What is he doing? Is that a pitching signal? Is he scratching his head? The vest and shirt seem theme-appropriate, but a baseball cap and jeans don''t.  As I said, confusing...</td>', 'I don''t know what to make of this image. The flying thing and fueling mechanism are very Jules Verne and Steampunky. But the guy in the baseball cap confuses me. What is he doing? Is that a pitching signal? Is he scratching his head? The vest and shirt seem theme-appropriate, but a baseball cap and jeans don''t.  As I said, confusing...', '2015-02-13 13:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7316743, 1141809, 96751, '<td valign="top">Interesting place for a back hoe...</td>', 'Interesting place for a back hoe...', '2015-02-13 13:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7316745, 1141535, 96751, '<td valign="top">Kudos for costuming and location. Here are the things that don''t work for me:<br/>lighting: harsh and flat, with weird vignetting at the bottom.<br/>composition: centered<br/>models:  unengaged. Like they were told to "look over there" but there''s no emotion.<br/> <br/>What is he holding?<br/>Why isn''t she brandishing that incredible weapon, or at least holding it so we can see it better?<br/> <br/>Great potential, though. Just needs a bit of finessing.</td>', 'Kudos for costuming and location. Here are the things that don''t work for me:lighting: harsh and flat, with weird vignetting at the bottom.composition: centeredmodels:  unengaged. Like they were told to "look over there" but there''s no emotion. What is he holding?Why isn''t she brandishing that incredible weapon, or at least holding it so we can see it better? Great potential, though. Just needs a bit of finessing.', '2015-02-13 13:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
