(7318814, 1141777, 137576, '<td valign="top">middle of the road 5 from me, just off centre composition to start with move her to the left 2 foot etc have a loo at the golden rules and fibonacci spiral, <a href="//digital-photography-school.com/divine-composition-with-fibonaccis-ratio-the-rule-of-thirds-on-steroids/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//digital-photography-school.com/divine-composition-with-fibonaccis-ratio-the-rule-of-thirds-on-steroids/</a> <br/> <br/>yes its a steampunk challenge but the dull copper colour cast does nothing to make this a wow picture, what relevance the ghostly figures have is beyond me that don''t add anything to the image and this image does scream steam punk, maybe middle pirate girl.<br/> <br/>her pose is somewhat "what you looking at" body language isn''t great and the location is random like she was walking down the street doing some shopping and you took a quick snap shot<br/> <br/>the lighting doesn''t match the scene, you,ve got hair light which contrast with the light in the background image<br/> <br/>it appears you''ve cranked the contrast and lost all detail in her dress/basque its just black even on my calibrated 27" iMac<br/> <br/>whats the weird thing bottom left corner?<br/> <br/>give her some steam punk glasses and loose the random background and you might have bumped up a score or two <br/> <br/>seems a top hat would have helped as well <br/> <br/><a href="https://www.google.com/search?q=steam+punk&amp;safe=off&amp;client=safari&amp;rls=en&amp;source=lnms&amp;tbm=isch&amp;sa=X&amp;ei=c9vmVOvHEIH-UProgvgK&amp;ved=0CAgQ_AUoAQ&amp;biw=2154&amp;bih=1146#safe=off&amp;rls=en&amp;tbm=isch&amp;q=steampunk&amp;spell=1&amp;imgdii=_" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">https://www.google.com/search?q=steam+punk&amp;safe=off&amp;client=safari&amp;rls=en&amp;source=lnms&amp;tbm=isch&amp;sa=X&amp;ei=c9vmVOvHEIH-UProgvgK&amp;ved=0CAgQ_AUoAQ&amp;biw=2154&amp;bih=1146#safe=off&amp;rls=en&amp;tbm=isch&amp;q=steampunk&amp;spell=1&amp;imgdii=_</a> <br/> <br/>miantstream sells on dpc voters are in the majority sheep getting them to change their narrow voting criteria is a challenge that in 4 years or more I''ve only once or twice succeeded in.  <br/></td>', 'middle of the road 5 from me, just off centre composition to start with move her to the left 2 foot etc have a loo at the golden rules and fibonacci spiral, //digital-photography-school.com/divine-composition-with-fibonaccis-ratio-the-rule-of-thirds-on-steroids/  yes its a steampunk challenge but the dull copper colour cast does nothing to make this a wow picture, what relevance the ghostly figures have is beyond me that don''t add anything to the image and this image does scream steam punk, maybe middle pirate girl. her pose is somewhat "what you looking at" body language isn''t great and the location is random like she was walking down the street doing some shopping and you took a quick snap shot the lighting doesn''t match the scene, you,ve got hair light which contrast with the light in the background image it appears you''ve cranked the contrast and lost all detail in her dress/basque its just black even on my calibrated 27" iMac whats the weird thing bottom left corner? give her some steam punk glasses and loose the random background and you might have bumped up a score or two  seems a top hat would have helped as well  https://www.google.com/search?q=steam+punk&safe=off&client=safari&rls=en&source=lnms&tbm=isch&sa=X&ei=c9vmVOvHEIH-UProgvgK&ved=0CAgQ_AUoAQ&biw=2154&bih=1146#safe=off&rls=en&tbm=isch&q=steampunk&spell=1&imgdii=_  miantstream sells on dpc voters are in the majority sheep getting them to change their narrow voting criteria is a challenge that in 4 years or more I''ve only once or twice succeeded in.  ', '2015-02-20 02:01:53.000000', NULL, 0),
