(7318830, 1141797, 156466, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jgirl57:</b></div><hr/><i> Dramatic feel, really like the deep contrasting on this composite, well put together </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>This "composite" was put together in Bethlehem, PA back in the late 1800''s on the banks of the Lehigh River.  What you have here is just a small view of what''s left of the Bethlehem Steel furnaces, closed down for a couple decades now.  It''s being preserved as a part of an art and entertainment facility, and one of these days I''m going to do something other than shoot thru/over fences.</td>', 'Originally posted by jgirl57: Dramatic feel, really like the deep contrasting on this composite, well put together   This "composite" was put together in Bethlehem, PA back in the late 1800''s on the banks of the Lehigh River.  What you have here is just a small view of what''s left of the Bethlehem Steel furnaces, closed down for a couple decades now.  It''s being preserved as a part of an art and entertainment facility, and one of these days I''m going to do something other than shoot thru/over fences.', '2015-02-20 05:48:27.000000', NULL, 0),
